{
  "id": "injector_check",
  "title": "Injector Check",
  "description": "INPA-style injector check for B58 / B48 / B38 engines: injector corrections, rough running and misfires per cylinder, fuel pressures, a 30 s idle test and the engine's fault memory. Read-only.",
